The symbolic icons in this directory are copied from the GNOME
adwaita-icon-theme project (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme)
and are licensed under either the GNU LGPL v3 or Creative Commons
Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 United States License, at your option.

They are bundled so Riff renders correctly on desktops whose GTK icon theme
(e.g. Breeze on KDE Plasma) does not provide these icon names.
